error[E0545]: an array cannot be compared with an array slice
 --> test-code/errors/wasm/E0545-comparison-array-slice-mismatch.mu:6:17
  |
4 |     a := [const]Int { 2, 3, 5 }
5 |     b := [const]Int { 2, 3, 5 }
6 |     are_same := a == b[:]
  |                 ^ these two are not compared with each other
7 |     return 0
  |
  = note: an array, a dynamic array and an array slice are only compared with their own kind, even
          when their elements are the same: the length of an array is known when the program is
          compiled, the length of a dynamic array changes, and a slice views some of the elements of
          another
  = help: compare slices of both, as in 'a[:] == b[:]'
